      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We are the step before the removalist. We take the samples, a NATA-accredited laboratory does the analysis, and licensed Victorian removalists quote the removal themselves, for homeowners across Geelong, the Bellarine, the Surf Coast and Golden Plains.</p>
