<section style="padding:72px 24px;background:#EAF5FB;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Are you licensed asbestos removalists?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">No, and we never say otherwise. Removal is carried out by licensed asbestos removalists we work with, and their WorkSafe Victoria licence number appears on every quote. We are not NATA accredited either: that accreditation belongs to the laboratory that analyses the sample. The same logic runs through the whole job, since the person who issues a clearance certificate has to be independent of the removalist and of whoever commissioned the work.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">So what do you actually do?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">We take samples and a NATA-accredited laboratory analyses them, usually back within one to five business days. We explain what the report says in plain terms, and if asbestos is detected we put you in touch with licensed removalists who quote the job themselves. From there you deal with them directly, and when the work is at your own home and you engaged the licence holder, the duty to obtain the clearance certificate sits with them rather than with you.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Why don't you publish your own prices?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Because they would not be ours to publish. The ranges on this site are what Victorian suppliers and councils publish, mostly on a Melbourne-metro basis, since nobody publishes a Geelong or Barwon rate for this work. GST treatment varies between providers too, so ask each removalist whether their quote includes GST.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
